CDI -  Senior Digital & Data Marketing Consultant – Paris &lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact est une nouvelle génération de société spécialisée dans le conseil en data et en marketing digital data-driven, dont les 2500 employés répartis sur 27 pays ont pour mission de transformer les données de nos clients en impact business tangible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La société est née en France en 2014 et à connu une croissance forte, sur son métier historique, le conseil data marketing, mais aussi progressivement sur tous les cas d’usages data appliqués à l’entreprise. Artefact est soutenu par des investisseurs de premier plan (Cinven), européens, et qui visent à bâtir un leader mondial dans son secteur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le département Digital &amp;amp; Data Marketing d’Artefact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein des bureaux parisiens, l’équipe Digital &amp;amp; Data Marketing d’Artefact France est composée de 70 consultants dont le rôle est de construire les stratégies digital marketing les plus adaptées aux enjeux de nos clients, de les déployer et d’en mesurer la performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En fonction des besoins des clients, nous aurons un rôle de conseil (stratégie, diagnostic de performance, modèle opérationnel, feuille de route, …) et/ou un rôle de mise en oeuvre avec les opérations de campagne et le déploiement de mesure du ROI (attribution/incrémentalité/MMM)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ces projets s’appuient sur une expertise complète des canaux marketing et des plateformes en Paid Social, Paid Search, Programmatique, Retail media, mais aussi sur une expertise avancée et en plein développement du GEO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui recherchons-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce contexte, nous recherchons pour accompagner notre croissance un(e) consultant(e) digital &amp;amp; data marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités principales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le/La consultant(e) digital &amp;amp; data marketing pilote, avec une large autonomie, des projets complets de bout en bout. Localisé dans des équipes chez le client ou dans nos bureaux parisiens, il/elle sera supervisé/e par un n+1 (manager, directeur, partner) et il/elle sera amené(e) à possiblement encadrer les consultants juniors.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pilotage d’un ou plusieurs streams projet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le delivery d’une mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les points de blocage et identifier des pistes de résolutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fournir des feedbacks constructifs aux membres plus juniors de l&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production des livrables de mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire de manière autonome des présentations (benchmarks, études de cas/marché, workshops decks, sections steerco) en collaboration horizontale avec les équipes d’experts (Paid Social, Paid Search, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des storylines (messages clés, contenu, stratégie média / d’activation / marketing...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer et animer les interviews et workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduite de la relation client&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire une relation de confiance avec les clients en garantissant une qualité de livrables best-in class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Démontrer de l&#39;assurance dans les situations d’appel d’offres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier de potentielles opportunités business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez 2 à 3 ans d&#39;expérience professionnelle dans un cabinet de conseil ou agence digital &amp;amp; data marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un profil avec une culture ‘business’ x ‘data’ x ‘marketing’&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux(se) et passionné(e) par les sujets liés à la data, au marketing, et à l’évolution technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un état d&#39;esprit analytique et aimez résoudre des problèmes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez : Suite Google/Pack Office, outils de workshop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience avec les outils digitaux sera appréciée : Google Analytics, Google Ads, Meta Business Manager, TikTok Ads, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une excellente communication (écrite / orale) en &lt;strong&gt;Français&lt;/strong&gt; et en &lt;strong&gt;Anglais&lt;/strong&gt; est obligatoire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package de rémunération : 45K fixe à 50K fixe (selon profil) + 4K de variable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien fit, Manager Conseil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec étude de cas en direct avec un Directeur Conseil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien final, Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion et diversité :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Media Consulting  9th arrondissement of Paris, 75009, Paris

Fullstack Web Developer &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Fullstack Web Developer to join our Web Apps team, in our Zürich office. In this role you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The web apps team plays a central role at Auterion and owns the systems that add connectivity and remote interfaces for fleet management and operations. Our services are responsible for ingesting and analyzing flight telemetry data, managing and updating the fleet as well as integrating with other systems across the stack.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across all the team’s web based projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate services between edge devices and our centralized services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle new feature discovery, prototyping and investigations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Customer Success team in debugging and resolving customer issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze user usage patterns and other statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push initiatives to clean up, upgrade, and refactor existing services to reduce technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve integrations with 3rd party services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a Fullstack web development or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Node.js&amp;nbsp; ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Typescript ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with modern SPAs (Vue.js ecosystem preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Postgres/SQL (queries, transactions, views, indexes, triggers) as well as ORM systems (Prisma)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Docker and container orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD pipelines (GoCD and GH Actions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and observability tools (Datadog, Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Zurich

Software Engineer II, Security &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer II, Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Belfast, NI / Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(This role requires working in-office 3 days per week.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote is a leading AI-powered growth solutions partner for regulated property and casualty insurance entities, enabling the largest insurance carriers and thousands of agents to maximize customer acquisition across digital channels. Fueled by our proprietary data assets and our AI traffic engine, EverQuote is transforming the way providers attract and engage consumers to grow market share.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our team puts you at the forefront of this transformation. You will collaborate with a group of builders to solve complex problems and reshape a massive industry. If you want to drive real-world impact and do the best work of your career, you’ve found your home. We move fast, follow the data, and hold ourselves to high standards. If that&#39;s how you work too, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI is seeking a Software Engineer II, Security to join our team! In this role, you will join a team that bridges the gap between Security Engineering and Compliance to streamline vulnerability management. You will work proactively to maintain a security testing process that enables Product and Engineering teams to provide business value in a secure environment. As a senior engineer, you will be an important member of the team and instrumental in the design and delivery of key business applications and solutions. You will have input in architecture decision-making within the team and ensure we build scalable, performant, easy to maintain and cost-optimised solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and trialling new security tooling for our SDLC, particularly in the AI space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding solutions to engineering challenges in the security space, primarily using Python and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocating and consulting with other engineers on security best practices and secure-by-design methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining security data products such as SBOM, asset inventory, cloud infrastructure, and SIEM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring, logging, triaging and escalating cyber security threats, as well as documenting security events including IoC (Indicators of compromise).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting and collating security assessments through a variety of methods as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating reports and working collaboratively with engineering teams to remediate identified issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing support and training for teams where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years work experience as a Security Analyst, Security Engineer, or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in programming languages such as Java, Python, Go, and / or SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with AWS cloud platforms and particularly their security tools such as Security Hub, IAM, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of principles such as risk assessment, threat modelling, the OWASP Top 10, information security practices, and encryption theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a clear understanding of secure development best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous integration and deployment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Linux environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset, want to grow a business, and love working with a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using data to support and validate your concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced work environment where everyday contributions have a big impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly diagnose and solve code problems, as well as help others unblock themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about sharing knowledge and mentoring teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in variable cash bonus programs, equity, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility which are designated by role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your role during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statement on Fair Employment and Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI is committed to ensuring equal opportunity for all job applicants and employees. We will not discriminate on the grounds of religious belief, political opinion, race, gender (including gender reassignment), sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, pregnancy or maternity, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a registered employer in Northern Ireland, EverQuote NI complies with the Fair Employment and Treatment (Northern Ireland) Order 1998. As part of the application process, you will be asked to complete a fair employment monitoring form; this information is used solely for monitoring purposes and does not form part of the shortlisting or selection decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI carries out background checks on all candidates offered a position. A criminal record will not automatically disqualify you from working with EverQuote NI Limited; each case is considered on its individual merits in line with our fair recruitment practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Adjustments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments or accommodations at any stage of the interview process, please let us know and we will work with you to arrange them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=6XmzUHfuQ-i5S31_qCIpcQCQtcZ6e1ZCg-K9ZDUrOSjhU2y_ydujWqUSk1qbf0g08qVEJgBQCRrYN_rQ6s8R1bQPdaN9iF-VnAt04umDr2dE8nvrwxpZdkrAXEGT1B1W&quot;&gt;https://investors.everquote.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=77BAgL1nVeMykQsQieJyMOhYF-A1vLMHTvEuCfBOEZ3y8__JO9djvQmh39yBJX6yJu8z7nHYbHDvvyVkE2tBDSmNhEC7b1rXdBhuOD6_EEW4-W-Bal3QIK35pntX1W7wpCEWJkz5Ouui49uO507CTSlujcntR_vtPWE-rgBZ5E-p2PqAuo57e5Qv4Tv6QhC-n6qQjfy6QyTWRFcSaZnBetOgWYZADxcw-o4FsA_59RFz1Jt7fklOmQ8TWFMdjowUuoeYy-eog8rwjsES_lJwEPPqVjfaCHv76iX7KX3pOhGVuO1kDfKFQNaGgpnnqIY3W8mYzPeMJEisnZ6PgV4sgO1EVe7cY0cS8JDoOc9JMsBma3kScg5NSRPdt1ZNQvAnsjfWLaj8Q0Xmg9vqEkXqhvPvYuXbpSBpuADuxOKh8Yn2rAJzPdDDRbBgVEuYzlbVwrHM27mDXBGESKq_dfkYajMWrNGjbF3dg4omuuCvDpneGp3mrnk6IMTmwiogaLCXrp6dHSw_rVHsXixipTUhAXy7Gd_5_zeuDewZ1X_4gSV-f-fuipPZ42u2YD6RiUF-mP4WAjF7yUJkbh0nMJjY0g==&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Belfast, Northern Ireland

Director, Enterprise Sales &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yext (NYSE: YEXT) is the enterprise agentic marketing platform. Built on the world&#39;s most comprehensive structured data platform for local businesses, Yext gives brands and their partners the visibility intelligence to win every moment of discovery – across AI and traditional search. Yext&#39;s API-first architecture connects structured data to APIs, MCP servers, and generative interfaces, so partners and developers can build purpose-built experiences on the same infrastructure powering Yext&#39;s own products. Thousands of brands and digital marketing partners in financial services, healthcare, retail, hospitality, and food rely on Yext to manage, measure, and optimize visibility at scale. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://yext.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;yext.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Enterprise Sales&lt;/strong&gt;, you are responsible for growing our client base with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;. You are committed to winning and taking advantage of the untapped customer base that could benefit from Yext’s product offering. Individuals should have a proven track record of consultative sales; the ability to negotiate complex six and seven figure contracts; a strong understanding of the digital landscape and a willingness to embrace innovative, fast paced technology companies. If this is you, we offer best in class compensation with uncapped commissions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead and grow your own book of business, selling to our top accounts and working with FSI Customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive significant growth in the market for both existing and new clients, achieving or exceeding individual quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on implementing transactions in an assigned territory and prospect for new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complete and complex sales-cycles presenting to C-level executives the value of our product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, implement, and own an engagement plan for key prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage positive relationships within our Enterprise market segment, looking for opportunities to make valuable contributions for the customer and develop additional revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Territory/Vertical identification and research, to formalise a go to market strategy and build qualified target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast sales activity and revenue achievement, while creating satisfied and referenceable customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree or similar university level education. In lieu of degree, relevant skills or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally 10+ years experience selling SaaS technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All candidates, who may not have the above-listed years’ experience, but can demonstrate the vital skills, may apply and will be considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to reach and develop relationships with C-level executives in key verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of digital ecosystem landscape and relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of success in carrying a quota, closing FSI deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful history of net direct new business sales, with the ability to prove consistent delivery against targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of success in selling business applications and complex solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance a strategic view to an account with a fast-paced transactional approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of over-achieving quota (top 10-20% of company) in past positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and closing complex sales-cycles- demonstrated ownership of all aspects of territory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in bringing innovative / market defining products to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must work well in a team selling environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a marketing performance environment with a solid understanding of SEO and SEM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local, Display and/or Search market experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AW1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yext is an equal opportunity employer committed to building a results-driven, engaging culture where every employee has the opportunity to contribute to the success of the Company, perform at the highest possible level, and grow their skills and capabilities. Yext welcomes employees and applicants of all backgrounds and demographics, and does not engage in discrimination on the basis of any protected characteristic recognized under applicable law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. The Company believes a broad variety of life experiences across the Yext team is critical to its mission to help every business in the world be visible everywhere customers search. By seeking out fresh perspectives and fostering a positive interview experience and employee experience, Yext can remain at the forefront of innovation, and better serve its customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
